1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,230
Seated leg extensions.

2
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:03,101
The move you use

3
00:00:03,101 --> 00:00:04,550
for climbing stairs.

4
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:05,436
Sit tall and

5
00:00:05,436 --> 00:00:06,040
hold the sides

6
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,415
of your seat.

7
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:08,711
Start with a

8
00:00:08,711 --> 00:00:09,872
small lift.

9
00:00:09,872 --> 00:00:10,696
Straighten your leg

10
00:00:10,696 --> 00:00:12,315
just halfway.

11
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,000
If that's comfortable,

12
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:15,743
straighten it all

13
00:00:15,743 --> 00:00:16,405
the way,

14
00:00:16,405 --> 00:00:18,280
toes to the ceiling.

15
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,027
Keep your leg

16
00:00:19,027 --> 00:00:20,362
pointing straight ahead…

17
00:00:20,362 --> 00:00:22,283
and lower it slowly.

18
00:00:22,917 --> 00:00:23,904
Want more?

19
00:00:23,904 --> 00:00:24,519
Hold it up for

20
00:00:24,519 --> 00:00:25,964
a count of three.

21
00:00:31,833 --> 00:00:33,249
If your knee complains,

22
00:00:33,249 --> 00:00:34,550
make the lift smaller.

23
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:36,227
That still counts.

